<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Robert Cornell initiated coverage of Rockwell International Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $3.55 per share for 1997 versus $3.11 for 1996.</p>
<p>-- set price target of $72.  Shares fell 1/4 to 61.</p>
</text>
